        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 801AVH, Avalon Double Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis stylish handleset features edged rectangle mounts. The Avalon Double Cylinder is operated by key outside, and key inside. Solid brass construction ensure to last for many years to come and it is backed by a lifetime mechanical warranty. Good for 1-3/4\" thick doors with 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Double Cylinder Handleset:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on both the inside and outside; and the latchbolt is operated by a turnknob inside and a thumbpiece outside. In order to increase security, double cylinder handlesets are usually used on front or back doors where there is a window in close proximity to the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/avalon-single-cylinder-handleset-kwikset-800avh\"><b>Avalon Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/avalon-dummy-cylinder-handleset-kwikset-802avh\"><b>Avalon Dummy Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Avalon Double Cylinder Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A156.5 Grade 1 Deadbolt</li>\r\n<li> SmartKey cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>Bump-resistant deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-pry shield.</li>\r\n<li>Polymer coating.</li>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass with solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 801AVH Avalon Door Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length Overall: 18-5/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Length: 12-13/20\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt to Latch Spacing: 5-1/2\" center to center</li>\r\n<li>Center of Latch to Center of Throughbolt:  8-13/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Cross Bore: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" doors.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: please specify</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handleset is customisable with a huge selection of interior trim knobs and levers and additional finish color options just <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for all the options! \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Avalon Double Cylinder Handleset, Kwikset 801AVH",
                "description": "Kwikset 801AVH Avalon Double Cylinder Handleset - This stylish handleset features edged rectangle mounts. The Avalon Double Cylinder is operated by key outside, and key inside. Solid brass construction ensure to last for many years to come and it is backed by a lifetime mechanical warranty. Good for 1-3/4 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
